<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<title>{% block title %}AI 日报{% endblock %}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ base_url }}/assets/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="{{ base_url }}/">AI 日报</a>
    <nav class="site-nav">
      <a href="{{ base_url }}/">首页</a>
      <a href="{{ base_url }}/archive.html">归档</a>
      <a href="{{ base_url }}/corrections.html">更正记录</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>{{ ai_disclosure }}</p>
    <p>本页内容由 AI 辅助整理生成，信息以原始来源为准。发现错误请通过 <a href="{{ base_url }}/corrections.html">更正入口</a> 反馈。统计分析仅使用匿名聚合数据，不采集个人身份信息。</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
